## Description

Adds an optional confetti burst when marking a session as done, gated behind a new setting (off by default).

Reuses the existing chat "upvote" animation plumbing (`MenuEntryActionViewItem.onClickAnimation` + `triggerConfettiAnimation`), which already respects reduced-motion preferences — no new animation code.

- **Setting** (`sessions.contribution.ts`, constant in `views/sessionsList.ts`): new boolean `sessions.markAsDoneConfetti`, default `false`.
- **Toolbar hook** (`views/sessionsList.ts`): the per-session `MenuWorkbenchToolBar` now supplies an `actionViewItemProvider` that, for the archive/done action when the setting is enabled, renders the item with `onClickAnimation: ClickAnimation.Confetti`.

```ts
actionViewItemProvider: (action, options) => {
    if (action instanceof MenuItemAction && action.id === ARCHIVE_SESSION_COMMAND_ID && this.configurationService.getValue<boolean>(SESSIONS_MARK_AS_DONE_CONFETTI_SETTING)) {
        return scopedInstantiationService.createInstance(MenuEntryActionViewItem, action, { ...options, onClickAnimation: ClickAnimation.Confetti });
    }
    return undefined;
}
```

